  "description": "CommunityToolkit.Maui integration for SkiaUi.Maui: drawn pickers (and other drawn controls with popups) show their popups in the toolkit's Popup, and drawn counterparts of the toolkit's DockLayout and UniformItemsLayout.",
  "iconFile": "nuget-icon.png",
